WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.070
I did hear a dog bark,
while you were speaking,

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.650
so eloquently in the background.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.770
Yeah, yeah, that was Bo.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.400
Yeah, okay, well I just

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.353
He doesn't know that I'm on a podcast.

00:00:12.353 --> 00:00:13.936
You didn't explain?

00:00:13.936 --> 00:00:15.430
You didn't explain to Bo that -

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:16.870
I did, no, I did.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:20.818
In fact, I had someone give
him meat to take him away.

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:21.830
(laughing)

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.940
Then he's like right up
under my feet breathing,

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.447
he breathes heavy, he's
just such a heavy breather.

00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:27.280
(laughing)

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.640
And then it's all these plugs.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.040
I'm like, you're gonna unplug everything.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.092
(laughing)

00:00:33.092 --> 00:00:34.700
You know, I wish you had,

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.900
I'm guessing that you probably

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.593
put someone in charge of
keeping an eye on Bo, during.

00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:40.207
I thought I did.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.820
You know what I say to that?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.874
Thanks, Obama.

00:00:42.874 --> 00:00:45.020
(laughing)

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.371
I know just who to blame.

00:00:46.371 --> 00:00:47.350
(laughing)

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.126
I know just who to blame.

